# Title: GAC DLL Loaded Via Office Applications
# ID: 90217a70-13fc-48e4-b3db-0d836c5824ac
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Antonlovesdnb
# Date: 2020-02-19
# Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1204.002
# Description: Detects any GAC DLL being loaded by an Office Product
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((process_name:*\\excel.exe OR process_name:*\\mspub.exe OR process_name:*\\onenote.exe OR process_name:*\\onenoteim.exe OR process_name:*\\outlook.exe OR process_name:*\\powerpnt.exe OR process_name:*\\winword.exe) AND ImageLoaded:C:\\Windows\\Microsoft.NET\\assembly\\GAC_MSIL*)
